The relay is the blind store-and-forward server described in
specs/backend/relay/. It has no dependency on any commercial-layer vendor: no
Clerk, no Stripe, no control plane client, no account concept, no license check
and no callback. Running it requires the binary, a Postgres database and a disk.

The Weald macOS client is a separate work and is NOT covered by this license.
